    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brendan Kearns, Hills Property, is pleased to present 35 Manor View Park, Letterkenny, a substantial 7 bedroom property to the market.\r\n\r\nSituated within the established Manor View Park development, the property enjoys an excellent location just minutes from Letterkenny University Hospital, Atlantic Technological University and Letterkenny Town Centre. A wide range of amenities including schools, shops, sporting facilities, employment centres and public transport links are all within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\nEntrance Hallway\r\n Central entrance hallway with staircase to first floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n Approx. 5.4m x 5.0m (17'9\" x 16'5\")\r\n Spacious front-facing reception room with feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n 5.4m x 3.1m (17'9\" x 10'2\")\r\n Generous fitted kitchen offering ample worktop and storage space.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n Approx. 4.0m x 3.4m (13'1\" x 11'2\")\r\n Ground floor double bedroom suitable for a variety of uses including guest accommodation, home office or playroom.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n 2.6m x 2.5m (8'8\" x 8'1\")\r\n Practical utility area with additional storage and rear access.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n 1.5m x 0.9m (5'0\" x 3'1\")\r\n Convenient ground floor WC.\r\n\r\nSecond Living Room\r\n 4.5m x 3.1m (14'10\" x 10'2\")\r\n Additional reception room offering flexible family living space.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\n 4.5m x 4.0m (14'10\" x 13'1\")\r\n Bright open-plan kitchen and dining area with access to rear garden.\r\n\r\nShower Room\r\n 2.4m x 1.7m (7'11\" x 5'7\")\r\n Ground floor shower room serving the additional living accommodation.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nLanding\r\n Providing access to all first floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Ensuite)\r\n 3.6m x 3.5m (11'10\" x 11'6\")\r\n Generous double bedroom with ensuite shower room.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n 1.7m x 1.4m (5'6\" x 4'7\")\r\n Shower, WC and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n 3.5m x 3.1m (11'6\" x 10'2\")\r\n Well-proportioned double bedroom.\r\n\r\nShower Room\r\n 2.0m x 1.9m (6'7\" x 6'3\")\r\n Family shower room serving the first floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n 3.4m x 2.6m (11'2\" x 8'8\")\r\n Comfortable bedroom with built-in wardrobe storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (Ensuite)\r\n 5.1m x 4.5m (16'9\" x 14'10\")\r\n Large principal bedroom with ensuite shower room.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n 3.2m x 2.3m (10'6\" x 7'6\")\r\n Spacious ensuite incorporating shower, WC and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 6\r\n 3.8m x 2.6m (12'5\" x 8'8\")\r\n Double bedroom overlooking the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 7\r\n 2.6m x 2.2m (8'6\" x 7'3\")\r\n Single bedroom suitable as a nursery, study or home office.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area:\r\n Approx. 2,300 sq.ft. (214 sq.m.)\r\n\r\nSummary:\r\n 7 Bedrooms • 2 Living Rooms • 2 Kitchens • 2 Ensuite Shower Rooms • 2 Additional Shower Rooms • Utility Room • Guest WC • Approx. 2,300 sq.ft. (214 sq.m.)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extending to approximately 214 sq m / 2,300 sq.ft., the property provides spacious and highly adaptable accommodation over two floors. Currently arranged to provide two living areas within the one dwelling, the property is being offered for sale as a single residential unit and presents an opportunity for purchasers seeking substantial living space with a high degree of flexibility.  \r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance hallway, spacious living room, kitchen, utility room, WC and a large double bedroom. \r\nA second living area incorporates a further living room, kitchen/dining room and WC/shower room, creating excellent additional accommodation suitable for extended family living, visiting guests or a variety of other requirements.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor there are six further bedrooms, including two bedrooms with ensuite facilities, together with an additional shower room. The generous room sizes and versatile layout provide excellent accommodation for larger families, multi-generational households, investors or those requiring dedicated work-from-home, hobby or guest space.\r\n\r\nThe property has a practical layout that can readily adapt to changing family / tenant needs. The combination of seven bedrooms, multiple reception areas and dual kitchen facilities is seldom found in a residential property within such a convenient town location.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking and enclosed side and rear garden space.  There is ample room to extend or to use this space to build a self-contained modular home subject to planning permission."
      },
      {
